+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Resilient teardown execution
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Add shared teardown execution that attempts all callbacks and
+  teardown signal receivers, then reports collected errors; verify focused
+  teardown tests pass.
+- [ ] 1.2 Preserve unconditional context-local restoration while deferred
+  teardown errors leave context pop; verify no app or request context remains
+  active after a teardown failure.
+
+## 2. Regression coverage
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add tests covering multiple request and application teardown
+  callback failures, signal receiver failures, ordering, and exception-group
+  contents; verify `tests/test_appctx.py` passes.
+- [ ] 2.2 Run the provided public context test command and OpenSpec strict
+  validation; verify both complete successfully.
